1
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:10,450
Trust me. No one was there. I didn't see anybody.

2
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:14,040
A truck just jumped out in front of us, and the car slipped,

3
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:19,480
and we... I mean I...

4
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:22,120
I hit the drum in the construction site nearby.

5
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,840
I got out of the car and checked myself.

6
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:27,540
But we didn't find the drum at the scene of the accident.

7
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,830
I moved it to the side so that no one else would get hurt.

8
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:34,130
- Please, go check one more time. - I don't need to check.

9
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,900
- Kwang Soo. - Yes.

10
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:48,230
Yoo Jung said that she was trying to avoid a truck.

11
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:52,060
That truck driver might be the only witness.

12
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:59,940
- Find him. And find out what happened on that day. - Yes, sir.

13
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,630
I know Min Hyuk.

14
00:02:05,710 --> 00:02:08,680
The way he looked at her

15
00:02:10,570 --> 00:02:12,310
is love.

16
00:03:02,940 --> 00:03:09,970
- I...- It's okay. Everyone will make a mistake.

17
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:13,010
It's not a mistake.

18
00:03:39,610 --> 00:03:43,350
Don't you think it's going to be a long night?

19
00:03:45,130 --> 00:03:48,400
That's a deep cut. You should go to the hospital.

20
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:55,510
Can you stay with me tonight?

21
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:05,190
No. It's not true.

22
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:08,490
He was proved to be innocent during the election.

23
00:05:08,490 --> 00:05:12,030
He was there to support a candidate.

24
00:05:12,530 --> 00:05:16,020
It had nothing to do with our foundation.

25
00:05:16,670 --> 00:05:18,370
I have to go.

26
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:33,170
Have some. We have a lot of things to do.

27
00:05:36,370 --> 00:05:39,650
The building materials sponsored by K Corporation,

28
00:05:39,650 --> 00:05:42,240
I hope we can get it as soon as possible.

29
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:46,600
Are you really going to marry him?

30
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:52,320
You told me that we're living in different worlds.

31
00:05:53,380 --> 00:05:56,610
I'm going to marry Min Hyuk in this world.

32
00:05:56,610 --> 00:05:59,530
Min Hyuk knows that as well.

33
00:06:01,190 --> 00:06:04,590
I don't need love.

34
00:06:04,590 --> 00:06:08,940
So you're going to date with me in my world.

35
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:12,520
You don't like the idea?

36
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:16,970
Was your heart broken last night?

37
00:06:17,550 --> 00:06:20,840
It it hurs just tell me.

38
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:24,610
My heart breaks to see you pretending to be okay.

39
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:28,350
I have a meeting. I have to go.

40
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:36,320
Mommy. Mommy.

41
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:39,510
My god.

42
00:06:42,370 --> 00:06:52,980
Mommy! Mommy...

43
00:06:52,980 --> 00:07:00,110
- It's okay. Don't cry. - Mommy! Mommy!

44
00:07:00,110 --> 00:07:05,830
What is this? Look!

45
00:07:08,270 --> 00:07:12,630
Mommy! Mommy!

46
00:07:12,630 --> 00:07:14,740
Where is your mommy?

47
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:19,410
Say thank you.

48
00:07:19,410 --> 00:07:21,540
You son is so cute.

49
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:25,340
I can't take my eyes off him for even a second.

50
00:07:25,490 --> 00:07:27,730
You little rascal.

51
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:45,770
Mommy. Mommy.

52
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,720
Drink it.

53
00:08:36,540 --> 00:08:41,880
You said this gives you energy when you're down.

54
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:44,930
Don't let me drop it.

55
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:54,350
It's hot.

56
00:08:57,210 --> 00:08:58,810
Thank you.

57
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:07,450
Are you going to keep avoiding me?

58
00:09:16,340 --> 00:09:18,770
- The things hapeed that day... - I've already forgotten.

59
00:09:18,770 --> 00:09:20,740
Who ask you to forget it?

60
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:23,300
I said it wasn't a mistake.

61
00:09:25,550 --> 00:09:28,860
- Sir! - I'm extremely busy at the moment.

62
00:09:30,130 --> 00:09:34,640
But I'm here to see you.

63
00:09:35,100 --> 00:09:39,390
I can't survive without seeing you.

64
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:09,180
This is the contract from the Hannamdong lady.

65
00:10:09,850 --> 00:10:11,750
You earned it.

66
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:15,610
Take it to Do Hoon yourself.

67
00:10:16,590 --> 00:10:21,130
- Kwang Soo will drive you there. - Thank you.

68
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:42,800
It's good to see you like this.

69
00:11:10,310 --> 00:11:12,440
- You have a guest. - Come on in.

70
00:11:38,830 --> 00:11:42,280
Please go through it.

71
00:11:46,340 --> 00:11:48,760
I can't make the decision myself.

72
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:51,360
You have to wait for the approval of the board.

73
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:54,620
- You don't want to approve it? - What are you talking about?

74
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:05,710
Wanting what's not yours is not a good thing.

75
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:09,910
How dare you say that to me?

76
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:15,210
Who made me become like this? If you're done, get out.

77
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:19,750
Why can't I say that?

78
00:12:19,750 --> 00:12:22,870
You're going this far by your own will,

79
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:26,150
and you're the one who has to pay the price.

80
00:12:27,590 --> 00:12:31,910
Don't act like you're a victim. It's disgusting.

81
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:37,830
Mr Jo. asked me to take the files tomorrow.

82
00:12:40,510 --> 00:12:42,340
What do you want?

83
00:12:43,990 --> 00:12:45,850
You want compensation?

84
00:12:49,730 --> 00:12:51,530
Compensation?

85
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:55,780
How can you compensate me?

86
00:12:56,720 --> 00:13:01,860
You took my son away from me and left my father to die in the street.

87
00:13:03,610 --> 00:13:06,580
How much should I get?

88
00:13:07,230 --> 00:13:12,620
I should ask around. What would your parents think?

89
00:13:12,620 --> 00:13:15,460
- Kang Yoo Jung! - Don't say my name!

90
00:13:18,580 --> 00:13:21,710
I'll get that compensation.

91
00:13:23,580 --> 00:13:29,720
You'll pay for what you have done, get ready for that.

92
00:13:55,440 --> 00:14:00,720
- I saw Ms. Kang enter her place. - Good. You can go.

93
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:08,500
Ms. Kang visited the bakery again after she left Mr. Ahn's office.

94
00:14:12,750 --> 00:14:14,490
Can I ask you something?

95
00:14:16,340 --> 00:14:21,740
Why aren't you giving her back that bakery?

96
00:14:23,060 --> 00:14:24,970
I don't want her to leave.

97
00:14:26,470 --> 00:14:36,010
I'm worried that she might disappear if I give it back to her.

98
00:15:09,930 --> 00:15:12,660
Hello. It's me, Yoo Jung.

99
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:17,480
I need to ask you a favor.

100
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:37,270
Hello, sir!

101
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:40,470
- Take this as collateral. - Sir!

102
00:15:40,470 --> 00:15:43,120
The customer is always right, right?

103
00:15:44,470 --> 00:15:46,610
You should listen to your customer.

104
00:15:49,830 --> 00:15:51,560
Yoo Jung!

105
00:15:54,010 --> 00:15:56,600
I'm sorry to bother you.

106
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:58,970
I'm not supposed to do this.

107
00:15:58,970 --> 00:16:01,530
That's why I'm asking you.

108
00:16:01,530 --> 00:16:04,800
Usually you won't do that.

109
00:16:06,570 --> 00:16:10,090
- It won't cause any trouble, right? - Right.

110
00:16:11,730 --> 00:16:17,520
October 1st. It was in the southbound lane after 11 p.m. and had a Hi-Pass card.

111
00:16:20,450 --> 00:16:23,830
This is the car and the license plate number.

112
00:16:23,830 --> 00:16:27,140
I need information about when the car came back to Seoul.

113
00:16:39,130 --> 00:16:43,340
Yoo Jung, how come Mr. Jo doesn't come these days?

114
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:47,480
He isn't working here.

115
00:16:57,810 --> 00:16:59,990
Mr. Jo is really sick.

116
00:17:16,620 --> 00:17:20,760
He got an infection around his ankle, and he gets a fever because of it.

117
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:24,440
- Has he seen a doctor? - His doctor had already checked.

118
00:17:25,630 --> 00:17:27,050
Thank you.

119
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:30,780
So... What should I do?

120
00:17:30,780 --> 00:17:34,030
I have somthing to do. So...

121
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:31,860
Don't touch that.

122
00:19:40,990 --> 00:19:45,480
Why are you here?

123
00:19:46,470 --> 00:19:49,070
Are you feeling better?

124
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:53,810
Aren't you hungry?

125
00:19:54,210 --> 00:19:57,580
I heard you haven't had anything to eat today.

126
00:20:40,450 --> 00:20:42,290
But,

127
00:20:44,530 --> 00:20:47,310
I guess you have nothing wrong with your hands.

128
00:21:01,120 --> 00:21:05,130
If you're done eating, I'm going to go.

129
00:21:05,490 --> 00:21:07,680
That music box

130
00:21:09,180 --> 00:21:11,480
was my mother's.

131
00:21:13,530 --> 00:21:20,050
That music reminds me of her.

132
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:25,000
I'm not angry at you.

133
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:28,650
I was scared.

134
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:31,090
What were you scared of?

135
00:21:31,660 --> 00:21:38,590
My mother died because of me.

136
00:21:40,210 --> 00:21:44,180
If I hadn't gone into that room.

137
00:21:48,050 --> 00:21:49,790
No.

138
00:21:52,390 --> 00:21:55,800
I should never have done this.

139
00:22:06,250 --> 00:22:13,430
I don't want to think about how much my mother would've hated me.

140
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:20,590
No mother would hate their own child for something like that.

141
00:22:21,490 --> 00:22:25,160
My mother wasn't happy at all in this place.

142
00:22:25,650 --> 00:22:30,270
She'd always look out near the window.

143
00:22:30,900 --> 00:22:35,520
As if she couldn't leave here because of me.

144
00:22:41,230 --> 00:22:43,400
That was it.

145
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:46,390
That was it.

146
00:22:46,870 --> 00:22:50,090
There must be a misunderstanding.

147
00:22:50,520 --> 00:22:53,100
Even though I don't know why,

148
00:22:53,470 --> 00:22:57,660
if she really wanted to, she would've left.

149
00:22:57,990 --> 00:23:01,050
It's not that she couldn't leave because of you,

150
00:23:01,370 --> 00:23:07,060
she was able to stay here thanks to you.

151
00:23:08,190 --> 00:23:11,570
If she knew that you were so painful,

152
00:23:12,870 --> 00:23:15,910
she'd be more painful.

153
00:23:19,580 --> 00:23:21,730
I had...

154
00:23:25,660 --> 00:23:28,290
A child.

155
00:23:31,370 --> 00:23:33,650
So...

156
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:37,550
You can trust me.

157
00:23:55,550 --> 00:23:58,140
Stay!

158
00:24:03,320 --> 00:24:06,490
Can you stay with me for a while?

159
00:24:57,640 --> 00:25:01,760
You're close with Kim Jae Ha recently.

160
00:25:03,120 --> 00:25:06,970
Thanks to Mr. Jo, we've become friends.

161
00:25:08,390 --> 00:25:13,420
I found out who spread the rumor about President Jo.

162
00:25:15,140 --> 00:25:17,010
It was Se Gwang.

163
00:25:17,340 --> 00:25:23,630
You shouldn't do anything suspicious. That's my advice.

164
00:26:06,390 --> 00:26:07,930
Please look at the camera.

165
00:26:08,730 --> 00:26:10,460
Can you turn this way, please?

166
00:26:10,660 --> 00:26:12,970
Don't think you're doing me a favor.

167
00:26:13,210 --> 00:26:15,840
Our target is not only your restaurant.

168
00:26:16,030 --> 00:26:17,720
Stop playing games like this.

169
00:26:17,910 --> 00:26:18,890
Games?

170
00:26:19,080 --> 00:26:20,360
This.

171
00:26:21,530 --> 00:26:24,410
This is what we always do, right?

172
00:26:26,950 --> 00:26:30,140
The press conference is over. Pleas go this way.

173
00:26:30,490 --> 00:26:32,050
Let's go out and talk.

174
00:26:32,120 --> 00:26:35,020
I'm busy. I have to attend my father's election party.

175
00:26:37,090 --> 00:26:40,690
I finished the book, WutHae Ring Heights.

176
00:26:42,140 --> 00:26:45,920
Revenge, which started because of love, ends in tragedy.

177
00:26:46,270 --> 00:26:47,990
Is that it?

178
00:26:48,620 --> 00:26:49,800
I have to go now.

179
00:26:49,860 --> 00:26:52,020
I'm wondering though,

180
00:26:52,860 --> 00:26:55,380
what if things are the other way around.

181
00:26:57,640 --> 00:27:02,280
What happens to love that starts from revenge?

182
00:27:06,210 --> 00:27:08,360
Think about it.

183
00:27:28,130 --> 00:27:31,090
The board permits it and the legal team signed it.

184
00:27:31,430 --> 00:27:32,910
Congratulations!

185
00:27:34,230 --> 00:27:37,010
You can't handel it simply by getting the investment,

186
00:27:37,610 --> 00:27:40,220
Se Gwang still wants King's Restaurant.

187
00:27:40,410 --> 00:27:44,900
Mr. Jo won't give up the restaurant that easily.

188
00:28:05,290 --> 00:28:07,560
I took care of the press.

189
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:11,870
Things aren't going well, and if this gets out,

190
00:28:12,260 --> 00:28:15,680
no one will trust Jo Min Hyuk's company.

191
00:28:15,990 --> 00:28:17,130
What do you want to say?

192
00:28:17,280 --> 00:28:20,430
This whole thing started because of you.

193
00:28:20,720 --> 00:28:25,870
All the restaurant staff are worried because of you.

194
00:28:29,370 --> 00:28:31,760
Don't pretend that you're caring about them.

195
00:28:32,010 --> 00:28:36,330
You just want to keep your position.

196
00:28:36,490 --> 00:28:38,280
Yes. You're right.

197
00:28:39,140 --> 00:28:42,430
I have a duty to protect the K Corporation.

198
00:28:43,350 --> 00:28:46,030
If Jo Min Hyuk falls, it'll hurt our company.

199
00:28:46,230 --> 00:28:52,370
I'm telling you this because you seem very familiar with him.

200
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:54,350
Tell Jo Min Hyuk,

201
00:28:54,580 --> 00:28:57,720
He should beg Mr. Kim for forgiveness.

202
00:28:58,450 --> 00:29:02,040
He should say that he did it because of a woman,

203
00:29:02,800 --> 00:29:08,460
It'll be good for both him and the K Corporation.

204
00:29:15,020 --> 00:29:16,960
Hello. Se Yeon.

205
00:29:17,520 --> 00:29:22,730
No, that's okay. I'll be right there.

206
00:29:38,760 --> 00:29:40,630
What are you doing here?

207
00:29:40,850 --> 00:29:45,420
I'm sorry. I'm here to apologize.

208
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:48,080
Because of me, you and Mr. Jo...

209
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:52,570
I'll not let it slide because of your apology.

210
00:29:53,420 --> 00:29:55,810
He's such a coward.

211
00:29:56,190 --> 00:29:58,230
He sent you instead?

212
00:29:58,390 --> 00:30:01,090
No, it's not like that.

213
00:30:01,430 --> 00:30:03,640
He doesn't know that I'm here.

214
00:30:03,930 --> 00:30:08,290
I'm the one who should apologize to you.

215
00:30:08,500 --> 00:30:10,630
What do you think you're doing?

216
00:30:10,970 --> 00:30:13,740
It's not in the 80s.

217
00:30:15,100 --> 00:30:18,030
Hey! Get up!

218
00:30:19,250 --> 00:30:21,140
Get up!

219
00:30:27,630 --> 00:30:31,690
Thanks to you, I collected useful information for my company...

220
00:30:32,250 --> 00:30:37,360
But I can't just forgive Min Hyuk for what he did.

221
00:30:38,610 --> 00:30:41,510
He's got a hot fiancee like Se Yeon

222
00:30:41,700 --> 00:30:45,070
and other pretty girls all around him.

223
00:30:46,100 --> 00:30:51,890
How can he be obssessed with a sbustandard product like you?

224
00:30:55,550 --> 00:30:58,900
He sure has a unique taste in girls.

225
00:31:00,400 --> 00:31:03,760
Come on. Pour me a drink.

226
00:31:04,210 --> 00:31:07,720
Whether I'll accept your apology or not depends on your performance.

227
00:31:43,450 --> 00:31:45,070
Driver.

228
00:31:48,490 --> 00:31:50,280
Where have you been?

229
00:31:51,190 --> 00:31:54,950
It's your day off, so you hang out all day long?

230
00:31:56,250 --> 00:31:57,990
Where did you go?

231
00:31:59,690 --> 00:32:02,010
How's your ankle?

232
00:32:03,540 --> 00:32:05,600
Can you walk?

233
00:32:07,660 --> 00:32:09,770
That's good.

234
00:32:12,860 --> 00:32:14,940
I'll go now.

235
00:32:18,130 --> 00:32:19,440
Driver!

236
00:32:21,020 --> 00:32:24,380
Are you okay? Does it hurt?

237
00:32:26,160 --> 00:32:28,280
It's better thanks to you,

238
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:31,140
but it still hurts.

239
00:32:34,100 --> 00:32:36,400
Isn't Kwang Soo with you?

240
00:32:36,740 --> 00:32:38,010
Why are you here alone?

241
00:32:38,180 --> 00:32:41,720
Kwang Soo is working. Don't worry about him.

242
00:32:42,010 --> 00:32:43,940
Ah.

243
00:32:47,520 --> 00:32:49,050
Right.

244
00:32:50,280 --> 00:32:51,980
Here.

245
00:33:00,010 --> 00:33:02,090
Did you go get the contract?

246
00:33:04,180 --> 00:33:05,840
Nothing happened?

247
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:08,100
No.

248
00:33:09,670 --> 00:33:13,220
It's getting late. You should go home.

249
00:33:47,380 --> 00:33:49,020
What?

250
00:33:51,840 --> 00:33:53,950
He's recovered.

251
00:33:54,260 --> 00:33:57,320
That's why I said people should obey the law.

252
00:33:57,640 --> 00:33:59,420
They requested to reinvestigate the case,

253
00:33:59,560 --> 00:34:01,350
so they won't let it slide.

254
00:34:01,610 --> 00:34:03,730
We did it to raise funds.

255
00:34:03,990 --> 00:34:07,010
Mr. Choi should explain himself.

256
00:34:08,250 --> 00:34:09,900
I'm not that righteous,

257
00:34:10,050 --> 00:34:12,620
but I'll try my best.

258
00:34:13,000 --> 00:34:14,800
You should be careful, too.

259
00:34:14,990 --> 00:34:18,120
Mr. Choi can tell the judge that he did it because your father made him.

260
00:34:18,300 --> 00:34:20,280
You know he's not that kind of person.

261
00:34:30,390 --> 00:34:34,260
Don't you know that Shina and Se Gwang have their eyes on the K Hotel?

262
00:34:34,550 --> 00:34:38,270
Se Gwang spread the rumor about your father.

263
00:34:38,470 --> 00:34:42,930
Isn't she the one from the hit-and-run case?

264
00:34:43,810 --> 00:34:45,850
What the hell are you doing?

265
00:35:14,140 --> 00:35:16,560
I told you to do what I asked you to do.

266
00:35:18,660 --> 00:35:21,550
Why did you do something I didn't ask?

267
00:35:26,610 --> 00:35:27,430
Well...

268
00:35:27,460 --> 00:35:28,990
Why did you see him?

269
00:35:29,020 --> 00:35:30,850
Why did you pour him a drink?

270
00:35:30,890 --> 00:35:32,710
To apologize.

271
00:35:33,380 --> 00:35:35,130
I heard that your company is in danger

272
00:35:35,170 --> 00:35:37,240
because of what happened that day.

273
00:35:37,270 --> 00:35:39,310
Did Ahn Do Hoon say that?

274
00:35:39,630 --> 00:35:40,950
I thought I did something wrong,

275
00:35:40,980 --> 00:35:43,090
so if I apologized...

276
00:35:43,120 --> 00:35:44,550
Why did you have to apologize?

277
00:35:44,580 --> 00:35:46,770
It wasn't your fault.

278
00:35:46,810 --> 00:35:48,020
It's my fault.

279
00:35:48,060 --> 00:35:50,790
I shouldn't have taken you there on that day.

280
00:35:50,820 --> 00:35:54,390
I wanted to apologize.

281
00:35:58,200 --> 00:36:02,720
I wanted to do something to help you.

282
00:36:03,160 --> 00:36:06,400
I can pour him a drink.

283
00:36:06,400 --> 00:36:09,650
I can kneel down.

284
00:36:09,650 --> 00:36:13,230
As long as it helps you, it doesn't matter.

285
00:36:13,230 --> 00:36:16,100
Why do you have to kneel to help me?

286
00:36:17,670 --> 00:36:22,040
It doesn't bother me at all.

287
00:36:23,630 --> 00:36:28,450
It bothers me.

288
00:36:31,270 --> 00:36:34,430
Don't kneel in front of anybody.

289
00:36:34,430 --> 00:36:37,390
I'll kneel myself if I have to.

290
00:36:45,730 --> 00:36:47,820
I have to get back to work.

291
00:36:52,730 --> 00:36:55,070
Let me ask you one thing.

292
00:36:56,700 --> 00:36:59,280
Did you do it for me?

293
00:37:03,210 --> 00:37:14,470
I had no other reason. It just bothered me.

294
00:37:14,780 --> 00:37:18,480
Thinking about you getting in trouble because of me,

295
00:37:18,720 --> 00:37:23,180
it bothers me a lot.

296
00:37:24,210 --> 00:37:27,280
I had no other reason.

297
00:37:52,490 --> 00:37:54,290
Good.

298
00:37:55,410 --> 00:37:57,530
It's been a long time...

299
00:37:57,610 --> 00:37:58,910
Dear!

300
00:37:59,340 --> 00:38:01,650
- I'm okay. - Dad.

301
00:38:04,060 --> 00:38:08,920
- Min Joo! No! - Mom! - I'm good.

302
00:38:08,920 --> 00:38:13,230
Your father is tired.

303
00:38:13,960 --> 00:38:16,380
You didn't miss me?

304
00:38:16,380 --> 00:38:19,290
Did you buy me cosmetics?

305
00:38:19,290 --> 00:38:24,100
- You can only get it from Germany. Did you get it? - Sure. I'll show you.

306
00:38:27,130 --> 00:38:30,970
Let's go.

307
00:38:39,600 --> 00:38:46,180
Gwang Min told me about the investment of western restaurant. You did a good job.

308
00:38:46,180 --> 00:38:48,340
It's just a start.

309
00:38:48,340 --> 00:38:50,490
I need to increase the revenues now.

310
00:38:52,430 --> 00:38:54,880
That's my son.

311
00:38:55,060 --> 00:38:57,880
Are you feeling okay?

312
00:38:57,880 --> 00:39:02,240
I have no intention ofretiring, yet. Don't worry.

313
00:39:06,690 --> 00:39:11,350
You can go. Don't distract from work.

314
00:39:22,980 --> 00:39:26,320
I don't know for sure if it was Ahn Do Hoon.

315
00:39:26,320 --> 00:39:28,500
Se Gwang has so many channels of information.

316
00:39:28,500 --> 00:39:31,130
I don't know where they got it from.

317
00:39:34,920 --> 00:39:36,340
So?

318
00:39:37,270 --> 00:39:42,400
- Excuese me? - When you have something to say, you make that expression.

319
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:45,400
Go ahead.

320
00:39:46,410 --> 00:39:52,040
Mr. Ahn started as the prosecutor of Seo Ji Hee's hit-and-run case.

321
00:39:52,760 --> 00:39:58,770
- I think Min Hyuk started reinvestigating it. - Why?

322
00:40:01,410 --> 00:40:03,700
It has to do with a girl.

323
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:06,390
Damn it!

324
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:16,960
Ms. Kang. We have met before.

325
00:40:41,230 --> 00:40:42,800
Have a seat.

326
00:40:50,870 --> 00:40:54,100
You work at our restaurant?

327
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:58,600
Yes, Min Hyuk hired her personally.

328
00:41:03,110 --> 00:41:10,090
You helped Min Hyuk get the investment. Thank you.

329
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:17,420
But I think your work here is done.

330
00:41:18,270 --> 00:41:22,920
You're not going to see Min Hyuk again, right?

331
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:29,330
Answer him. He's talking to you.

332
00:41:33,050 --> 00:41:37,990
- Well... - Min Hyuk is still not mature enough

333
00:41:37,990 --> 00:41:40,170
to find the right person for himself.

334
00:41:41,870 --> 00:41:45,520
I don't want to see him get hurt again because of a girl.

335
00:41:46,340 --> 00:41:48,680
I thought he learned his lesson.

336
00:41:48,680 --> 00:41:52,320
That's enough. The past is past.

337
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:59,570
I think she's smart enough to know.

338
00:42:02,260 --> 00:42:06,380
If you're not meant to be with each other, you should let him go.

339
00:42:10,090 --> 00:42:12,240
- We're ready to eat now. - Yes.

340
00:42:16,710 --> 00:42:19,290
- What's going on? - Don't speak that loud in front of your father.

341
00:42:19,580 --> 00:42:21,770
- He's still... - How can you make her sit there?

342
00:42:21,770 --> 00:42:24,040
What are you doing to her?

343
00:42:30,240 --> 00:42:32,530
Let's go!

344
00:42:34,920 --> 00:42:36,730
Kwang Soo!

345
00:42:38,420 --> 00:42:43,530
What are you doing? Let me go! Kwang Soo!

346
00:42:43,530 --> 00:42:48,170
- Mr. Yoon. Get her out of here. - Yes. Madam.

347
00:42:50,110 --> 00:42:53,720
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

348
00:42:54,960 --> 00:42:58,870
- Sorry. - I told you not to say sorry.

349
00:42:58,870 --> 00:43:02,160
I told you that you didn't do anything wrong.

350
00:43:03,580 --> 00:43:05,280
I'm sorry.

351
00:43:06,700 --> 00:43:09,220
Kang Yoo Jung! Kang Yoo Jung!

352
00:43:11,350 --> 00:43:12,740
Mr. Ahn.

353
00:43:12,740 --> 00:43:18,650
I heard that you know how to handle that girl.

354
00:43:20,150 --> 00:43:25,060
I wanted you to join us for dinner,

355
00:43:25,840 --> 00:43:28,630
but can you deal with her first?

356
00:43:42,100 --> 00:43:43,230
Mr. Ahn.

357
00:43:57,950 --> 00:44:02,870
See? That's the difference between them and us.

358
00:44:02,870 --> 00:44:03,820
I know.

359
00:44:03,820 --> 00:44:05,760
Don't get entangled with Min Hyuk.

360
00:44:05,760 --> 00:44:10,610
What about you? When will you stop entangling with Shin Se Yeon?

361
00:44:10,610 --> 00:44:11,410
Pardon?

362
00:44:11,410 --> 00:44:16,590
Do you think you are qualified to persuade me?

363
00:44:24,670 --> 00:44:26,310
Thank you.

364
00:44:29,880 --> 00:44:32,100
My father's bracelet.

365
00:44:32,760 --> 00:44:37,710
I know that you were registered as my father's contact.

366
00:44:37,710 --> 00:44:43,890
I was wondering if you started from the bracelet.

367
00:44:44,290 --> 00:44:46,320
What a luck.

368
00:44:57,140 --> 00:45:00,840
Don't hurt her.

369
00:45:00,940 --> 00:45:02,380
I'll protect her.

370
00:45:02,380 --> 00:45:03,670
Please don't hurt her.

371
00:45:03,670 --> 00:45:06,590
What are you doing in front of Se Yeon?

372
00:45:06,850 --> 00:45:09,120
I'm okay, sir.

373
00:45:10,220 --> 00:45:13,390
We're going to marry no matter what.

374
00:45:13,390 --> 00:45:15,890
I'll not marry you.

375
00:45:18,040 --> 00:45:20,790
Do you think it's possible?

376
00:45:22,620 --> 00:45:27,310
Seo Ji Hee didn't even have the chance to marry you,

377
00:45:27,980 --> 00:45:32,530
how can the girl who killed Ji Hee become part of your family?

378
00:45:34,430 --> 00:45:37,910
You won't become part of our family, either.

379
00:45:37,950 --> 00:45:39,580
Kwang Soo. Let me go!

380
00:45:40,380 --> 00:45:41,910
Let me go!

381
00:45:44,680 --> 00:45:47,960
I'll not going to marry Se Yeon, I don't need anything.

382
00:45:47,960 --> 00:45:51,530
Se Yeon and I have no obligation to each other.

383
00:45:51,530 --> 00:45:52,970
You...

384
00:45:57,860 --> 00:45:59,090
Sir!

385
00:45:59,770 --> 00:46:01,740
I'm okay. I'm okay.

386
00:46:03,290 --> 00:46:07,620
Min Hyuk, say that again!

387
00:46:09,120 --> 00:46:13,810
Don't hurt her.

388
00:46:14,480 --> 00:46:17,250
Even if it's you, I'll never forgive that.

389
00:46:38,470 --> 00:46:39,620
Let me go!

390
00:46:40,560 --> 00:46:43,840
Get out of my way. Let me go.

391
00:46:43,840 --> 00:46:47,780
Move. I said move! Let me go!

392
00:46:47,780 --> 00:46:49,350
Get out of my way.

393
00:46:51,590 --> 00:46:53,950
I'm worried about you.

394
00:47:20,810 --> 00:47:24,360
Kang Yoo Jung! Kang Yoo Jung!

395
00:47:33,950 --> 00:47:38,060
Yoo Jung! Kang Yoo Jung!

396
00:47:40,980 --> 00:47:42,520
Kang Yoo Jung!

397
00:47:45,600 --> 00:47:47,050
Kang Yoo Jung!

398
00:47:51,840 --> 00:47:54,300
I know you're in there.

399
00:47:56,410 --> 00:47:58,360
Kang Yoo Jung!

400
00:48:00,180 --> 00:48:01,890
Kang Yoo Jung!

401
00:48:12,770 --> 00:48:14,700
Go back!

402
00:48:19,450 --> 00:48:24,460
Thanks god you're here. I was afraid you might have disappeared again.

403
00:48:24,460 --> 00:48:26,080
Please go.

404
00:48:26,080 --> 00:48:28,580
I won't make the same mistake again.

405
00:48:28,870 --> 00:48:31,000
I don't care if my father kicks me out.

406
00:48:31,000 --> 00:48:32,140
Sir.

407
00:48:32,140 --> 00:48:35,960
I need you. I need you beside me.

408
00:48:35,960 --> 00:48:38,710
Stop sying that.

409
00:48:38,710 --> 00:48:41,670
Don't you care about how I feel?

410
00:48:41,670 --> 00:48:45,500
Why should I stay with you after being humiliated by those people?

411
00:48:45,610 --> 00:48:48,110
You don't want to stay with me?

412
00:48:48,170 --> 00:48:49,940
You said you were worried about me.

413
00:48:49,940 --> 00:48:52,590
Yes, I am.

414
00:48:53,220 --> 00:48:55,410
But that's it.

415
00:48:56,040 --> 00:48:58,720
I hate you.

416
00:48:58,720 --> 00:49:03,410
I love Ahn Do Hoon, I feel regret breaking up with him.

417
00:49:03,410 --> 00:49:09,560
I just hate what you have done to me. Please go.

418
00:49:09,560 --> 00:49:11,010
Driver!

419
00:49:14,120 --> 00:49:15,740
Driver!

420
00:49:15,920 --> 00:49:19,470
Open the door!

421
00:49:20,110 --> 00:49:21,700
Driver!

422
00:49:24,620 --> 00:49:26,430
Driver! Open the door!

423
00:49:26,890 --> 00:49:29,240
Driver! Driver!

424
00:49:30,710 --> 00:49:34,670
Open up! Open the door!

425
00:49:36,250 --> 00:49:38,180
Yoo Jung!

426
00:49:40,980 --> 00:49:43,770
Please open the door.

427
00:49:57,340 --> 00:50:01,990
Looking at you makes me tired.

428
00:50:01,990 --> 00:50:04,900
I try to forget the accident,

429
00:50:06,070 --> 00:50:09,160
but you keep reminding me of that.

430
00:50:09,160 --> 00:50:15,230
Come out! Let's talk face to face. Come on out!

431
00:50:15,230 --> 00:50:18,160
Please stop!

432
00:50:23,520 --> 00:50:29,170
I knew it.

433
00:50:30,240 --> 00:50:38,100
When it happened... I knew it wasn't just the drum.

434
00:50:38,100 --> 00:50:40,710
I knew about everything.

435
00:50:45,150 --> 00:50:50,210
If I'd been a little more cautious, Ms. Seo Ji Hee

436
00:50:51,720 --> 00:50:55,410
would be with you right now.

437
00:50:58,740 --> 00:51:02,310
I was so happy

438
00:51:03,160 --> 00:51:06,110
and I didn't want to interrupt it.

439
00:51:07,880 --> 00:51:14,750
I convinced myself that nothing had happened.

440
00:51:26,170 --> 00:51:33,450
I couldn't face it, so I avoided it.

441
00:51:35,000 --> 00:51:42,440
I'm the one who killed Seo Ji Hee.

442
00:51:51,920 --> 00:51:55,610
Whenever I see you, I think of that day.

443
00:51:56,620 --> 00:52:00,200
When I see you, the guilt suffocates me.

444
00:52:01,290 --> 00:52:04,420
You really makes me tired.

445
00:52:06,210 --> 00:52:12,850
I really really don't want to see you.

446
00:52:33,930 --> 00:52:35,680
I'll leave.

447
00:52:37,530 --> 00:52:39,520
I'll leave...

448
00:52:42,350 --> 00:52:44,740
Don't be so sad.

449
00:54:13,060 --> 00:54:14,770
Sir!

450
00:54:19,200 --> 00:54:22,070
You didn't do anything wrong.

451
00:54:23,010 --> 00:54:26,900
You always put my father before me.

452
00:54:30,920 --> 00:54:33,430
I found it.

453
00:54:36,650 --> 00:54:41,350
I found the truck that almost hit Ms. Kang's car on the day of the accident.

454
00:54:41,350 --> 00:54:43,380
I found it.

455
00:54:57,760 --> 00:55:00,010
I'm sorry.

456
00:55:02,550 --> 00:55:09,270
I did a terrible thing. I know it's unforgivable,

457
00:55:09,390 --> 00:55:12,360
but I came here again.

458
00:55:17,110 --> 00:55:19,880
I'm sorry that I'm too greedy.

459
00:55:21,370 --> 00:55:24,740
I know I shouldn't do that.

460
00:55:27,120 --> 00:55:29,310
Just one day.

461
00:55:31,140 --> 00:55:37,650
I wanted to have him for just one day.

462
00:55:40,890 --> 00:55:44,090
I know I don't deserve him.

463
00:55:45,890 --> 00:55:55,420
I know, but I wanted to hold his hand.

464
00:56:07,370 --> 00:56:09,610
I'm sorry.

465
00:58:15,360 --> 00:58:19,380
Next on secret love.

466
00:58:19,380 --> 00:58:23,080
Please let me be with her. I won't marry Se Yeon.

467
00:58:23,080 --> 00:58:25,690
Are you going to be okay?

468
00:58:25,690 --> 00:58:27,930
Isn't it what you want?

469
00:58:27,930 --> 00:58:30,950
What I want is you.

470
00:58:30,950 --> 00:58:33,850
He'll come back when his father falls.

471
00:58:33,850 --> 00:58:35,030
I'll help you.

472
00:58:35,030 --> 00:58:38,120
Mr. Choi will be subpoenaed soon.

473
00:58:38,120 --> 00:58:40,760
I don't know if I should do this.

474
00:58:40,760 --> 00:58:43,200
This happened recently, so it's easier to gather

475
00:58:43,200 --> 00:58:45,440
information than on the hit-and-run case.

476
00:58:45,440 --> 00:58:48,530
I can't end it here.
